#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:21
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You might have some neat scripts you have written in the Scripter Python "
"runner, but maybe you want to do more with it and run it automatically for "
"instance. Wrapping your script in a plugin can give you much more "
"flexibility and power than running scripts from the Scripter editor."
msgstr ""
"Morda imate nekaj čednih skriptov, ki ste jih napisali v Scripter Python "
"tekač, vendar morda želite storiti več z njim in ga zagnati samodejno na "
"primer. Zavijanje skripta v vtičnik vam lahko da veliko več prilagodljivosti "
"in moči kot zagon skriptov iz urejevalnika skriptov."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:23
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Okay, so even if you know python really well, there are some little details "
"to getting Krita to recognize a python plugin. So this page will give an "
"overview how to create the various types of python script unique to Krita."
msgstr ""
"Ok, torej, tudi če veste Python res dobro, obstaja nekaj majhnih "
"podrobnosti, da bi Krita prepoznati python plugin. Tako bo ta stran dal "
"pregled, kako ustvariti različne vrste python skript edinstven za Krita."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:25
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These mini-tutorials are written for people with a basic understanding of "
"python, and in such a way to encourage experimentation instead of plainly "
"copy and pasting code, so read the text carefully."
msgstr ""
"Ti mini tutorials so napisani za ljudi z osnovnim razumevanjem python, in na "
"tak način spodbuditi eksperimentiranje namesto enostavno kopiranje in "
"lepljenje kodo, zato preberite besedilo previdno."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:28
#, fuzzy
msgid "Getting Krita to recognize your plugin"
msgstr "Pridobivanje Krite, da prepozna vaš vtičnik"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:30
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A script in Krita has two components -- the script directory (holding your "
"script's Python files) and a \".desktop\" file that Krita uses to load and "
"register your script. For Krita to load your script both of these must put "
"be in the :file:`pykrita` subdirectory of your Krita resources folder (See :"
"ref:`resource_management` for the paths per operating system). To find your "
"resources folder start Krita and click the :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Manage Resources...` menu item. This will open a dialog box. Click the :"
"guilabel:`Open Resources Folder` button. This should open a file manager on "
"your system at your Krita resources folder. See the `API <https://api.kde."
"org/krita/html/index.html>`_ docs under \"Auto starting scripts\". If there "
"is no :file:`pykrita` subfolder in the Krita resources directory use your "
"file manager to create one."
msgstr ""
"Skript v Kriti ima dve komponenti - imenik skript (ki drži Python datoteke "
"vašega skripta) in datoteko \".desktop\", ki jo Krita uporablja za nalaganje "
"in registracijo skripta. Če želite krita naložiti skript, mora biti v "
"podimenik :file:'pykrita' vaše krita vire mape (Glejte :"
"ref:'resource_management' za poti na operacijski sistem). Če želite poiskati "
"mapo virov zaženite Krita in kliknite :menuselection:'Nastavitve --> "
"Upravljanje virov...' element menija. To bo odprlo pogovorno okno. Kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:'Open Resources Folder'. To bi moralo odpreti upravitelja "
"datotek v vašem sistemu v mapi Viri Krita. V razdelku »Samodejni zagonski "
"skripti« si oglejte <https://api.kde.org/extragear-api/graphics-apidocs/"
"krita/libs/libkis/html/index.html> api». Če ni podmape :file:'pykrita' v "
"imeniku Virov Krita uporabite upravitelja datotek, da ga ustvarite."

